# utf16String

- _utf16String([c₁ c₂ …])_

Answer a String of the Utf-16 decoding of _c_,
which must be a valid Utf-16 sequence.

```
>>> [913 914 915 945 946 947]
>>> .utf16String
'ΑΒΓαβγ'
```

* * *

See also: String, asciiString, utf8String, utf16List

